{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-06_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-06","title":"卷入洪流","storyCode":"11-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"2618222aa79dc1d9dab3c474685d22c73f7159ab5ff78ee991b2a2b9a41d7924","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"萨卡兹对城内的控制突然收紧。与此同时，一队萨卡兹雇佣兵进入工厂，准备秘密处决凯瑟琳等补给线信息的知情人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g2_dukegarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才你都瞧见了吗，摩根？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那几个仓库守卫紧张得团团转，结果什么都没看清，就被老子两下放倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，别嘚瑟了，这点炸肉干拿去，今天算你赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，就知道你不服气。下次换你跟我一起去啊达格达，让输的人放哨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们在盯着我们看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看什..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...你有什么事吗？没什么事的话让开，我忙着去厨房弄点喝的，干了这么多活儿，渴死老子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天你们不该那样做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指我们冒险引开萨卡兹的巡逻队，让你们的人从仓库里顺利脱身吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我是不是听错了？你们该说的是谢谢才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨迪恩区的战友们很感激你们，我们也是。这趟任务完成得很顺利。但是为什么要烧掉那仓库？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那仓库不是萨卡兹的，是普通维多利亚商人的！它现在只是被萨卡兹占了而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，这帮有钱人，心有多贪，胆就有多小。他们乐意帮萨卡兹，我就乐意让他们多吃点亏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，你们这种行为是在逼他们更快投向萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那更好。等这些人成了叛徒，下次见面老子烧的就不再是他们的仓库。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是自救军的做法，而是流氓的作派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊莎贝尔小姐，您还执意要与她们一起行动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里，我叫达格达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的没想到，伊莎......达格达小姐。阿勒黛小姐在给我们介绍您与那位殿下的身份的时候，我们本以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......推进之王第一天就告诉过你们，与自救军一起行动的是格拉斯哥帮，而不是亚历山德莉娜殿下与塔楼骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可难道您想看着一个混混领导我们，甚至坐上王座吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你*维多利亚粗口*凭什么这么说维娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，别亮刀，这可是在别人家里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多战士都宁愿追随您还有坎伯兰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住口！不，我是说，请不要再说下去了。只要我们还站在一起，你就不该说这样的话来伤害同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我失言。我向你们道歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该拦着我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不拦着你，维娜就要头疼了，还有罗德岛的小兔子和博士。下次你再冲动，记得多想想自己是跟谁一块来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......真没想到有天你会反过来说我冲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"环境在变，我总得适应的。你看达格达，不是适应得挺好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你别夸我，不习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当我想夸你？跟你过一样的日子，我难受得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是摩根，这几天我算是明白了一个道理，我们不适应的话，迟早跟不上维娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，肉干给你，今天算我俩谁都没赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿着吧，我没胃口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉娜，这几天我一直在想......这样的日子，就一定是维娜想过的吗？自从她来了这里，那些贵族和商人什么时候给过她应有的尊重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你错了，摩根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们迟早会发现维娜是一位好领袖，而且这份尊重不是什么应得不应得的，一定是维娜自己挣来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，阿勒黛小姐，你终于来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，最近在忙些琐事，总是脱不开身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你一度要给那套蒸汽甲胄找买家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的消息可真灵通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"只是些传言罢了，我听一位做生意的朋友说，最近可能有一套蒸汽甲胄会从伦蒂尼姆流出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"不过最后关头，交易取消了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"要我说，那么宝贝的物件，您可不能随意出手啊，眼下的行情可卖不出高价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的建议，家里仅剩的那点产业总还要想办法运转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，理解，咱们手头上那点小钱，对萨卡兹来说有什么意义呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宴会还没开始吗？你们不用等我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么行，这些年，您可是中央区我们这些倒霉蛋的主心骨！咱们能活着撑到今天，还多亏了您的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不敢去找那帮疯子谈条件，他们甚至连钱都不收！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说笑了，伯爵大人，我并没有任何荣誉的身份，只是出于对各位高贵的阁下如今处境的不平，仗义执言了几次罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，还说这些干嘛？坎伯兰家一定会在您的手中重新发扬光大的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，那些事情都是些陈年旧事啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"等到伦蒂尼姆重新安稳下来——啊，我也没有说现在伦蒂尼姆不安稳的意思啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，坎伯兰家在未来一定会得到我们的感谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托中校到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族＆精明的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向您致敬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托中校，您可真是操劳，最近我们的宴会，好久没有请动您的大驾啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定是在为了我们的和平奔走吧！我们由衷感谢您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"刚好，我最近有位朋友，弄到了几瓶好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"要是以前，我可实在拿不出手，不过如今的情况下，已经算稀罕啦，改天我就送到您的府上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......女士们，先生们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自今天起，不会再有宴会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后，各位都会接受军事委员会的审查，祝各位好运。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市侩的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等！您这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托中校，莱托中校！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛小姐，您可一定得帮我们再去找莱托中校聊聊！他这种玩笑可不能随便乱开，我......唉！这是要死人的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托中校，您等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹之前一直在拖延时间，他们放任这些脑满肠肥的废物继续歌舞升平，无非是不想给大公爵们一个团结起来的借口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪一位大公爵不想当维多利亚的主人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚贵族网络的中心就是伦蒂尼姆，得罪了伦蒂尼姆的贵族就是冒犯整个国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种对维多利亚的冒犯，会让大公爵们不得不放下对彼此间利益的盘算，进军伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而如今，萨卡兹们不在乎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们想做的事已经做到了。艾尔希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人认为伦蒂尼姆过去的几年是灾难，而如今——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争真的来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，那我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能不能和那几位贵族大人说的一样，去找莱托中校谈谈？也许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们喊我“主心骨”。可艾尔希，在萨卡兹掌控伦蒂尼姆之前，刚才的哪位先生小姐曾踏足坎伯兰府？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大公爵那些真正的朋友，又何时参与过这些装模作样的宴会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是那些筹码不够，或是明哲保身的贵族推出来的招牌而已，他们以坎伯兰的名号团结起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，成为目标的，就只会是坎伯兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家艾尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_658_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，艾尔希。通知自救军和罗德岛的朋友们，马上撤离公爵府，那里已经不安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后去看一看吧......那座属于我们祖先的庄园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族？","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族？","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"这是公爵给你的信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"刚在奥克特里格区待了没几天，又到海布里区来了。看看这些工厂和密密麻麻的楼房，我就没见过比这更憋人的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，等我们做完这趟任务，是不是又能回中央区了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"就算回去了，你又能干什么？曼弗雷德那家伙，到底是怎么把你这种没怎么杀过人的小孩都招来伦蒂尼姆的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是小孩子了！格林还在的时候，我们在哥伦比亚一起做过很多任务的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"老格林......呵，他把自己的命丢在了萨迪恩区，害得我来替他当保姆。我还不如早点剁了他的脑袋换赏金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......你们不是朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没有义务教你怎么当雇佣兵，小孩。好好完成你的任务，看着点地图。接下来往哪里走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十一号军工厂，就在前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德将军给的名单还挺长......这些都是知道点什么的老工人，对吧？只要把他们带到没人看到的地方干掉就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"要我说，还不如把整个工厂的人都杀光算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么为了生产线照常运作，要求我们“精准地把那些知情者封口，不要滥杀”......嘁，净给我们找麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让他是雇主嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"行了。收好名单，赶紧走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g4_ordnancefactory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一年多没见了，我可真想你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我该早点想办法联络大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说这种客套话，见到你我可高兴坏了。这一年里我跟所有人说，你会活着回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧那边的通风口。还记得吧？沿着管道爬出去，外边有一小块平台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好几年前，你跟我们打赌说，你要从那里跳出去，跳到隔壁厂房的屋顶上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都吓坏了。那平台有足足几十米高！摔下去不就完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你还是跳了。我们之中一开始只有你敢跳，后来......哈哈，后来汤米跳了，戴跳了，最后我也跳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次他们问我，你会不会已经死了，我都会叫他们抬头瞧瞧那通风口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......那会儿我们还真什么都不怕，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以这就是你在自救军的朋友吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，你这个朋友看起来就很有学问啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，自救军里什么人都有，看来真是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士确实是个很有学问的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我是自救军的合作伙伴。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还有合作伙伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来越来越像回事了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你这次回来是做什么的，有没有我能帮上忙的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯、"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，凯瑟琳，既然费斯特回来了，他是不是就不用走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别急着帮他说话。至于你，还有你的朋友，我们再换个地方说话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，你别怪凯瑟琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不在的这一年，都是凯瑟琳和那些萨卡兹周旋，我们厂才能做到一个人都没少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一次差点就出事了，她甚至闹到了城防军的领袖过来调解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，最近，萨卡兹们催得越来越紧了，凯瑟琳也很难做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道，帕特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么可能怪奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我加入自救军，当我真正了解到我将面对什么后，我才真正理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶当时做出的决定，有多困难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，说吧，这次回来是做什么的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是来找东西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，萨卡兹有一条隐藏的补给线，以此支撑着他们的疯狂战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而补给线的终点，我们现在确定，就在这片工业区中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要找到那条补给线。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"费斯特说，您最了解这片工业区。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶你是最了解这片工业区的人，我想，你肯定知道一些线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我才想要来找你帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夸我也没有任何好处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们只需要一些线索。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我们不会给工厂添任何麻烦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么觉得，我会帮你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定，我刚才已经让帕特去找那些萨卡兹雇佣兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样......那我也只能和其他人一起逃跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，你们四天前在萨迪恩区闹出来的那番动静，死了多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都记得他们的名字吗？你记得他们的脸吗？你记得他们每一个人死前是什么表情，说的最后一句话又是什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别回答，费斯特。别临时想一个答案来糊弄我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道这位“博士”是怎么想的，但我了解你。你觉得自己很聪明，而小聪明并不总能骗过死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳！不好了，门口出现了很多萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们马上离开这里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说，城防军的长官，莱托中校要见你，他们是来接你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔治，看好这两个外人，别让他们乱走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g4_ordnancefactory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抽烟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"别跟我套近乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托长官要见我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们厂最近应该按时完成了指标，没有什么值得长官操心的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"少废话了，长官要见你，跟我们来就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我一下，我还有些事要处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"老东西，不要搞错了，你没有选择权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太突然了，我总要交代一下工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等她一下也没有关系吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）将军的意思也是不要把事情做得太明显吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，你只有十分钟时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，他们找你要干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴，赶紧跟上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
